# --- OS ---
Thumbs.db
.DS_Store

# --- Uploads / generated reports ---
# Anchored to the repository root. An unanchored "reports/" matches at any depth
# and was silently excluding frontend/src/components/reports/, which is source
# code (AiReportCard.tsx) and must be tracked. Note that git cannot re-include a
# file whose parent directory is excluded, so a "!frontend/..." negation here
# would not work; the leading slash is the fix.
uploads/
/reports/
